nv1Quake @@VERSION@@ (@@VARIANT@@ build)
Installer created by Abigail / Abnormality Software (2026)

WHAT THIS IS
nv1Quake is a community experiment created by passionate fans of id Software
and NVIDIA. It ports GLQuake to the NVIDIA NV1 / Diamond Edge 3D accelerator,
and was made out of love and curiosity. If either company asks for these
applications to be removed, we will comply immediately.

It is an unofficial project. It is not made, endorsed or supported by id
Software or NVIDIA. "Quake" is a trademark of id Software. No id Software
graphics, logos or game data are included.

LICENCE AND SOURCE CODE
nv1Quake is derived from the Quake source code released by id Software under
the GNU General Public License on 21 December 1999. The full licence is in
COPYING.TXT. The code in the original id Software release is unchanged;
the NV1 port (renderer, software NV1 emulator, build and installer
scripts) was added on top.

The complete corresponding source code is available free of charge:
  Repository: @@SOURCE_URL@@
  Commit:     @@COMMIT@@
  A source archive of exactly this commit is published next to this installer
  (NV1Quake-@@VERSION@@-source.zip). If you cannot get it from there, ask
  and we will provide it.

GAME DATA
Quake's game data is NOT included. It remains copyrighted by id Software and
cannot be redistributed. Copy PAK0.PAK (and PAK1.PAK for the registered game)
from your own copy of Quake into the id1 folder inside the install directory.
This program may only be used with Quake data under the terms of id Software's
own shareware or registered licence. It must not be used commercially.

